**Ride & Dynamics:**
*   **handling_rating:** Excellent body control, keen to turn in, plenty of grip, nimble, holds its line. Steering is direct, well-weighted, responsive, but slightly lacking in feel. Stiffly sprung, but rarely uncomfortable. Good handling for an SUV.
*   **ride_comfort_rating:** Stiffly sprung, but rarely uncomfortable. Does a great job soaking up smaller bumps, high-speed ride is composed. Can have a harsher edge on sharp bumps with larger wheels. Low speed ride is very good, absorbs bumps well. Ride is supple if not plush, mostly very comfortable. Generally comfortable, but can be firm.
*   **cabin_noise_rating:** Diesel engine is refined but can be heard when pushed. Engine and cabin are quiet at highway speeds. Tyre noise can be noticeable. Generally good, but some engine/tyre noise noted.
*   **shift_smooth_rating:** 8-speed DCT is quick, snappy shifts, pleasingly aggressive in Dynamic mode. Can stutter a little at lower speeds (10-30 kmph). Generally smooth, but some low-speed hesitation.
*   **steering_feel_rating:** Direct, well-weighted, responsive, but slightly lacking in feel. Butter smooth and very responsive, but doesn't have the kick-back/vibration of hydraulic steering. Accurate, easy to place. Good, but lacks feel.

**Safety & Visibility:**
*   **adas_score:** Features include Active Lane Keeping Assist, Speed Limit Assist, Blind Spot Assist, Active Parking Assist, Reversing Camera, Front & Rear Parking Sensors, Forward Collision Warning (FCW), Automatic Emergency Braking (AEB), High-beam Assist (on some trims), TPMS (on some trims), 7 Airbags, Child Seat Anchor Points. Driver Assistance Package updated with better Active Steering Control. Good suite of modern ADAS features.
*   **visibility_rating:** Elevated seating provides a good view. Reworked dimensions and optimized roof pillars improve visibility compared to the previous model. Generally good.
*   **headlight_rating:** LED High Performance headlights standard. New LED headlights with adaptive high beam assist on facelift. Multibeam LED headlights with Adaptive Highbeam Assist Plus available. Excellent headlights available.
*   **security_rating:** Engine Immobiliser, Central Locking (Remote/Keyless), Speed Sensing Door Lock, Child Safety Lock. Standard modern security features.

