*   **audio_rating:** Mid-range sound system available. Standard system likely average. Optional system is better.
*   **usb_ports:** USB package plus includes multiple USB-C ports (Charge + Data transfer), including under the front centre armrest and rear centre console. Likely 4+ ports.

